md=f'# Capability ledger\n\nPinned snapshot `{SHA}`. Stable CAP IDs are editorial controls, not production certifications. The JSON twin records source lines and an experiment for each boundary. Every source citation below is pinned to the full immutable SHA. Source inspection is complete for these paths; experiments are **unrun in this ledger** and must be joined to actual validation records before claiming observed results.\n\n'
